## 获取应用发布列表

| method | GET |
|-|-|
| url | /v1.0/work/apps/{appIdorName}/tasks |
| buc login | false |

### Path parameters

| 参数名称 | 参数类型 | 必传 | 默认值 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|-|-|-|
| appIdorName | String | true | - | 应用 ID 或应用名 |

### Query parameters

| 参数名称 | 参数类型 | 必传 | 默认值 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|-|-|-|
| pn | Number | false | 0 | 页码，用于分页 |
| rn | Number | false | 20 | 每页记录数 |
| pub_env | Number | false | - | 发布环境 |
| pub_status | Number | false | - | 发布状态 |

### Returns

| 参数名称 | 参数描述 |
|-|-|
| tasks | 发布列表，对象结构为：(...[Task](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8dfb66h0t67j0phai), user: [User](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls369lxfelxab4mn50j), app: [App](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls4gore2dimt38o1v5g), iteration: [Iteration](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls6xiuwp43jozm69u9h), devbranches: [Change](https://alidocs.dingtalk.com/i/nodes/20eMKjyp810mMdK4Ho0P33q2JxAZB1Gv?utm_scene=team_space&iframeQuery=anchorId%3Duu_ls8c5351a5qllc8tzaq)[])[] |
| pn | 页码 |
| rn | 每页数量 |
| total | 总发布数 |

